Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:36:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] kk: Support polygon mode line and timestamp pools above 4096
 queries

DXVK requires fillModeNonSolid. Metal draws triangle edges as lines but
has no point fill mode, so report the feature and set the triangle fill
mode from the polygon mode.

Metal counter heaps hold at most 4096 timestamps, and Unreal Engine with
Direct3D 12 creates pools of 8192, which failed as out of device memory.
Back larger pools with several heaps.

Generated-by: LLM
